QtRocket is a C++ re-implementation of OpenRocket (https://openrocket.info), Copyright (C) 2007-2025 Sampo
Niskanen and others, licensed under the GNU General Public License version 3 or later. The component model,
aerodynamic and mass calculations, simulation engine and the .ork file format follow OpenRocket's design and
algorithms. The bundled motor database (data/motors/initial_motors.db) and example designs (data/examples/) are
taken from OpenRocket unchanged. The designs of older file format versions that the tests read (tests/data/ork/)
are example and test designs of OpenRocket's releases 0.9.3 to 23.09, copied unchanged from its repository;
tests/data/ork/README.md lists the release and the path of each.


Code translated from OpenJDK
----------------------------

To print numbers digit for digit as Java prints them, two source files translate parts of the class library of
OpenJDK (https://openjdk.org), Copyright (c) Oracle and/or its affiliates, licensed under the GNU General Public
License version 2 with the "Classpath" exception:

- src/util/FloatingDecimal.cpp: the binary-to-decimal conversion of jdk.internal.math.FloatingDecimal
  (BinaryToASCIIBuffer.dtoa), with some of its comments.
- src/util/DecimalFormat.cpp: the rounding of java.text.DigitList (set, shouldRoundUp and round).


